# KStudio conductor skills (P15)

Any agent in this repo MUST treat these as first-class:

| Slash | Authoritative skill |
| --- | --- |
| `/init` | `.kstudio/skills/init/SKILL.md` (global bootstrap when project root is absent) |
| `/status` | `.kstudio/skills/status/SKILL.md` |
| `/progress` | `.kstudio/skills/progress/SKILL.md` |
| `/plan` | `.kstudio/skills/plan/SKILL.md` |
| `/go` | `.kstudio/skills/go/SKILL.md` |
| `/yolo` | `.kstudio/skills/yolo/SKILL.md` |
| `/task` | `.kstudio/skills/task/SKILL.md` |
| `/loop` | `.kstudio/skills/loop/SKILL.md` |
| `/goal` | `.kstudio/skills/goal/SKILL.md` |
